Date: Thu, 4 Jun 2026 14:00:05 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 2/3] profile DB: yolov8_nano hetero cycles from FireSim
 measurement
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Re-ingested per-op cycles from a hetero FireSim run of yolov8 using
the bit-exact gemmini_im2col_full_C conv kernel (copied from dronet
cache). 64 gemmini_q31 rows + 140 V256D128_rvv rows updated. The
yolov8 run shows max_abs_err=22 in the output tail — the conv kernel
runs structurally fine but accumulates small drift on yolov8-specific
conv shapes that the dronet validation didn't exercise. Cycles are
still the right measurement to base scheduling on.

Backups preserved at *.prebitexact_backup. Source uartlog:
ModelBlaster artifacts/audit/firesim_yolov8_gemmini.uartlog
